      "canonicalType": "Formula",
      "label": "\\begin{aligned} b_{n-1} &= \\frac{a_{n-1} a_{n-2} - a_{n} a_{n-3}}{a_{n-1}} = \\frac{-1}{a_{n-1}} \\left|\\begin{array}{ll} a_{n} & a_{n-2} \\\\ a_{n-1} & a_{n-3} \\end{array}\\right|, \\\\ b_{n-3} &= -\\frac{1}{a_{n-1}} \\left|\\begin{array}{cc} a_{n} & a_{n-4} \\\\ a_{n-1} & a_{n-5} \\end{array}\\right|, \\cdots \\\\ c_{n-1} &= \\frac{-1}{b_{n-1}} \\left|\\begin{array}{ll} a_{n-1} & a_{n-3} \\\\ b_{n-1} & b_{n-3} \\end{array}\\right|, \\cdots \\end{aligned}",
